#: src/SprintMeeting.php:329
msgid "Opening & sprint goal"
msgstr "Opening & sprintdoel"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:330
msgid ""
"Restate the sprint goal and planned scope. Was the goal met — yes or no, and "
"why in one sentence."
msgstr ""
"Herhaal het sprintdoel en de geplande scope. Is het doel gehaald — ja of "
"nee, en in één zin waarom."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:337
msgid "Results in numbers"
msgstr "Resultaten in cijfers"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:338
msgid ""
"The numbers: planned vs done per the Definition of Done, plus carry-over. "
"Name what is not done — no discussion yet."
msgstr ""
"De cijfers: gepland versus af volgens de Definition of Done, plus carry-"
"over. Benoem wat niet af is — zonder discussie, dat komt later."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:345
msgid "Sprint items walkthrough"
msgstr "Doorloop van sprint items"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:346
msgid ""
"Walk through the sprint items together: update status, owner and notes, "
"resolve blockers, and decide per unfinished item whether it carries over or "
"returns to the backlog."
msgstr ""
"Loop de sprint items samen door: werk status, eigenaar en notities bij, los "
"blokkades op en besluit per onafgerond item of het meegaat naar de volgende "
"sprint of terug naar de backlog."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:353
msgid "Demo of the increment"
msgstr "Demo van het increment"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:354
msgid ""
"Each member briefly demos their own finished items — working functionality, "
"no slides, done items only. Agree the order upfront so it tells one story."
msgstr ""
"Ieder teamlid demonstreert kort de eigen afgeronde items — werkende "
"functionaliteit, geen slides, alleen items die echt af zijn. Spreek vooraf "
"de volgorde af zodat het één verhaal wordt."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:361
msgid "Stakeholder feedback"
msgstr "Stakeholderfeedback"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:362
msgid ""
"Collect feedback on the increment from stakeholders. Capture remarks below "
"and turn concrete insights into backlog items right away."
msgstr ""
"Verzamel feedback van stakeholders op het increment. Leg opmerkingen "
"hieronder vast en zet concrete inzichten direct om in backlog items."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:369
msgid "Wrap up & next steps"
msgstr "Afronding & vervolgstappen"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:370
msgid ""
"Summarise the key outcomes and confirm backlog changes. Then on to the "
"retrospective."
msgstr ""
"Vat de belangrijkste uitkomsten samen en bevestig backlog-wijzigingen. "
"Daarna door naar de retrospective."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:381
msgid "Opening & check-in"
msgstr "Opening & check-in"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:382
msgid "Everyone scores the sprint 1–5. Restate the goal: improve, no blame."
msgstr ""
"Iedereen geeft de sprint een cijfer van 1 tot 5. Herhaal het doel: "
"verbeteren, geen schuldvraag."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:389
msgid "Follow-up of earlier actions"
msgstr "Opvolging van eerdere acties"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:390
msgid ""
"Go through the actions agreed in the previous retrospective and those still "
"open from earlier ones: what was tried, what is stuck, what is the next "
"concrete step — and did completed changes help?"
msgstr ""
"Loop de acties door die in de vorige retrospective zijn afgesproken en de "
"acties die nog openstaan van eerdere: wat is geprobeerd, wat zit vast, wat "
"is de volgende concrete stap — en hebben afgeronde veranderingen geholpen?"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:397
msgid "Sprint in numbers"
msgstr "De sprint in cijfers"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:398
msgid ""
"A quick, neutral look at the sprint numbers as input for the conversation — "
"observations only, no conclusions yet."
msgstr ""
"Een korte, neutrale blik op de sprintcijfers als input voor het gesprek — "
"alleen observaties, nog geen conclusies."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:405
msgid "Collect input"
msgstr "Input verzamelen"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:406
msgid ""
"Everyone writes input in silence first (Start/Stop/Continue or Mad/Sad/Glad) "
"before anyone speaks."
msgstr ""
"Iedereen schrijft eerst in stilte input op (Start/Stop/Continue of Mad/Sad/"
"Glad) voordat er gesproken wordt."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:413
msgid "Cluster & vote"
msgstr "Clusteren & stemmen"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:414
msgid ""
"Group similar input and dot-vote the two or three themes that matter most."
msgstr ""
"Groepeer vergelijkbare punten en dot-vote de twee of drie belangrijkste "
"thema's."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:421
msgid "Decide actions"
msgstr "Acties bepalen"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:422
msgid ""
"Define at most two or three actions with an owner and a due date — more "
"usually means none get done."
msgstr ""
"Formuleer maximaal twee of drie acties met eigenaar en deadline — meer "
"betekent meestal dat er niets wordt uitgevoerd."

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:429
msgid "Wrap up"
msgstr "Afronding"

#: src/SprintMeeting.php:430
msgid "Short retro on the retro: was this useful, what do we change next time?"
msgstr ""
"Korte retro op de retro: was dit nuttig en wat doen we volgende keer anders?"

