#: src/SprintAssignGuard.php src/SprintAgility.php
msgid "%s%% is the maximum capacity per item. Approve the reason or lower the capacity."
msgstr "%s%% is het maximum per item. Keur de onderbouwing goed of verlaag het percentage."

