msgid "Capacity above the maximum"
msgstr "Capaciteit boven het maximum"

#: src/SprintAssignGuard.php src/SprintAgility.php
msgid "Credits past the agreement"
msgstr "Credits boven de afspraak"

#: src/SprintAssignGuard.php src/SprintAgility.php
msgid "Dot-votes every member may spend in the Cluster & vote phase. Nobody can vote on their own input. The top three themes become actions, the rest returns in the next retrospective."
msgstr "Aantal stemmen dat elk teamlid mag uitbrengen in de fase Clusteren & stemmen. Niemand kan op eigen input stemmen. De drie meest gekozen thema's worden acties, de rest komt terug in de volgende retrospective."

#: src/SprintAssignGuard.php src/SprintAgility.php
msgid "How the team votes on its retrospective input."
msgstr "Hoe het team stemt over de input van de retrospective."

#: src/SprintAssignGuard.php src/SprintAgility.php
msgid "Input that did not become an action last time. Add it to this retrospective with one click, or leave it and it disappears."
msgstr "Input die de vorige keer geen actie is geworden. Voeg hem met één klik toe aan deze retrospective, of laat hem staan en hij verdwijnt."

#: src/SprintAssignGuard.php src/SprintAgility.php
msgid "Keep the value to approve it, or lower it"
msgstr "Laat de waarde staan om goed te keuren, of verlaag hem"

